{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Its crop.</b> It is well known, and similar is הוי מראה ונגאלה." "<b>With its feathers.</b> With its feathers, and likewise מלא הנוצה." "<b>Beside the altar.</b> Outside." "<b>To the east.</b> For it is far from the place of glory." "<b>To the place of the ashes.</b> There too they shall place it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The comparison הוי מראה ונגאלה is cryptic; translated hyper-literally without resolution.", 1 "The phrase מלא הנוצה ('full of feathers') appears to be a cross-reference to another verse; left untranslated as it is ambiguous which citation is intended."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:28.799132539Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}